      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú gaaro i qoomaarós koón, nee umuú qoomaaro i gaarós koón baraakaá yaamuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, heé gadiyuús slaasláwár i slay a milá baraá gadiyeérose? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng gadiyér yaariir ar Mungú aa haniís dír muu ana ár, as kahhó' inooín niwa gadiyuusiya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú umuú gár hhoohhooe gana qoomaarósí tleéhh ar kawa hhoohhoó' iwa xeer, nee baraá muunuú heewo muruú iimu/uungw wasle nee oo alhhe'eesay wasle nguwa xu'utír wa slai gana qaás. Tam adoorihe kwa pa/ángwií haniisiiká muruú Mungú aa tlehhiít iimír iimu/ungo ay alhhe'eesaay nguwa tsaahhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng ngari tsaáhh gár hee gu gaa wa buu' ar qwala/ gu baa/ i káhh, nee tiwa qwal/atimis baraá hotaawós sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí sleeme a qeemu dír heewo, tí umuú heewo iwa /ayin nee iwa wahan nee iwa qwalaala/i as gadiyeerós tidá' hhohho' aa tleéhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a xuú' adór gadiyér Mungú ir hhitirutká. Gár ta doogi i káhh, laqaá ar ta /aareesi i káhh sleeme. Asma inós adoorí gana tleéhh as kuwa ilaiwawa/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruudá' dáw an kudá' aa qaroó tleehharuut, nee kudá' sa tleehharuút, an kudá' aa qaroó tleehharuut. Mungú an kudá' muruudá' aa waaraahh gu malé tlehhiít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinkwa nee tihe aníng gár naa tsaáhh baraaká daanduú yaamuwo a tí, didá' sakwasleemár ganaa' iwa deér tlakweema i dayá' nee didá' hotaá ganaa'á' iwa dayá', tlakweema iqo dayá' sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng nay baraá muunaáeénií oó', Mungú múk hota ganaá' nee múk tlakwe sleémeero gin sakwasleemuut, asma umuú qoomaaro Mungú gana qaás as gaarós nee as gadiyeérós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng nay baraá muunaáeénií oó', gawaá daanduú muko Mungú inooín gin iiaraa'ar as ngiwa tsaahhiya' adór inooíná kilá' tar makaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu nee makaay a wak, asma gadaádá' tlehharuut dír muko an tidá' tlehharuut dír makaywo sleeme. Muu in qaatl, makaay in qatliiyá' sleeme, sleémeero i hiinsliyá', hee makiito'o gár ngir ba/i i káhh, sleémeero a tawór huwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín sleémeero amór ta kay a wak. Inooín sleémeero dír i dahhiya' a baraá hhape, nee inooín tan kii/ baraá hhape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, heé ga xuú' a heemá qeeruú hee tam in tsa/án gáwtí alé, nee tam qeeruú makiito'o in /eét baráy alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe aníng ngay tsaáhh gár ganaa' dír heewo ar tí ga baa/ i káhh, tí hee gadiyeérós ngiwa saqwalalaa/i, asma gaarí an hariímarós, asma gár hee gu slaw amór aluuwo heé ga xuú' i kaahh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
